{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261112/photo/bkn-20261112121145846-1112_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261112131922\"/><p>寄往秘魯的郵遞服務延誤。</p><p>香港郵政今日（11月12日）宣布，接獲秘魯郵政機關通知，由於當地宣布緊急狀態，秘魯的郵件派遞服務會有所延誤。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T05:28:27.780702+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":75,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T04:11:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T10:17:30.099195+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T05:22:00.333056+00:00","content_hash":"12c687d469a78606d652b18562f2292d2b71f3e24af24d0153a0ce365d4e210f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}